@startuml 虚拟患者训练系统-训练会话时序图
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam ParticipantFontSize 13
skinparam NoteFontSize 11

title 完整训练会话流程 (含SSE流式对话与自动评分)

actor "学生" as Student
participant "前端\nReact SPA" as Frontend
participant "FastAPI\n后端路由" as Router
participant "Pipeline\n中间件管线" as Pipeline
participant "LLMClient\n多模型路由" as LLMClient
participant "数据库\nPostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Settlement\n结算服务" as Settlement

' ============================================================
' 阶段1: 开始训练
' ============================================================
group 阶段1: 开始训练

  Student -> Frontend: 选择病例, 点击"开始训练"
  Frontend -> Router: POST /training/start\n{case_id, config_id?}
  Router -> DB: 查询 Case + 验证权限
  DB --> Router: Case 数据
  Router -> DB: INSERT TrainingRecord\n(status=in_progress, start_time=now)
  DB --> Router: record_id
  Router -> Pipeline: 构建初始 prompt (患者问候语)
  Pipeline -> LLMClient: 调用患者模型生成 greeting
  LLMClient --> Pipeline: greeting 消息
  Pipeline -> DB: INSERT Message (role=assistant, greeting)
  Router --> Frontend: {record_id, greeting, case_name}
  Frontend -> Frontend: 渲染聊天界面, 显示问候语
end

' ============================================================
' 阶段2: 对话循环 (SSE 流式)
' ============================================================
group 阶段2: SSE 流式对话

  Student -> Frontend: 输入病史采集问题
  Frontend -> Router: POST /training/{id}/chat\n(SSE 流式)\n{content: "您哪里不舒服?"}

  note over Router: rate_limit 检查

  Router -> DB: INSERT Message (role=user)
  Router -> Pipeline: 构建 PipelineContext\n(stream_mode=True)

  ' -- 管线执行 --
  Router -> Pipeline: run_pipeline(ctx, pipe)

  activate Pipeline

  Pipeline -> Pipeline: [1] phase_guard\n检查阶段锁定

  Pipeline -> Pipeline: [2] operation_detector\n识别操作命令 (/bp, /temp...)

  Pipeline -> Pipeline: [3] operation_executor\n执行查体等操作

  Pipeline -> Pipeline: [4] emotion_tracker\n情绪状态机更新

  Pipeline -> Pipeline: [5] initiative_timer_reset\n重置患者主动追问计时器

  Pipeline -> Pipeline: [6] phase_transition\n判断是否进入下一阶段

  Pipeline -> Pipeline: [7] prompt_builder\n组装 system_prompt + messages + 情绪/操作注记

  Pipeline -> LLMClient: [8] llm_caller\n调用 LLM (stream=True)

  activate LLMClient
  LLMClient -> LLMClient: ProfileRouter 路由选 Key\n(健康检查 → 多 key 加权 → 熔断)

  note over LLMClient: 构造请求:\nprovider=deepseek\nmodel=deepseek-chat\ntemperature=1.0

  LLMClient -> LLMClient: POST /v1/chat/completions

  loop SSE chunk
    LLMClient --> Pipeline: data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"content":"..."}}]}
    Pipeline -> Pipeline: [9] identity_leak_check\n角色泄露检测
    Pipeline --> Frontend: SSE: {"role":"assistant","content":"..."}
    Frontend -> Frontend: 逐字渲染患者回复
  end

  deactivate LLMClient

  Pipeline -> DB: [10] persister\nINSERT Message (role=assistant)\n+ INSERT LLMCallLog

  Pipeline -> Pipeline: [11] side_effects\n更新情绪/initiative 缓存

  deactivate Pipeline
end

' ============================================================
' 阶段3: 结束训练
' ============================================================
group 阶段3: 结束训练

  Student -> Frontend: 点击"结束训练" 或 超时自动结束
  Frontend -> Router: POST /training/{id}/end
  Router -> DB: UPDATE TrainingRecord\n(status=completed, end_time=now)
  DB --> Router: OK

  Router -> Settlement: 触发结算队列\nenqueue(record_id)

  note over Settlement: 异步结算流程
  Settlement -> DB: 查询 messages + rubric
  Settlement -> Pipeline: 构建评分 prompt
  Pipeline -> LLMClient: 调用评分模型\n(scoring_prompt)
  LLMClient --> Pipeline: 评分结果 (19个维度)
  Pipeline -> DB: INSERT Score\n(total_score, detail_scores,\n strengths, weaknesses, suggestions)
  Pipeline -> DB: UPDATE TrainingRecord\n(scoring_status=completed)

  Router --> Frontend: {message: "训练已结束"}
  Frontend -> Frontend: 轮询 /training/{id}/score, 展示评分
end

@enduml
